  "name": "Wildcard mounts preserve the chosen mount's cast time and cancellation (#4600)",
  "contract": "Wildcard Mount 91944 and Wildcard Flying Mount 93539 must use a normal mount cast. Green Riding Nether Ray 39798 has a 1500 ms cast (SpellCastTimes 16) and native local-mount variants 498697 on the ground or 498695 with 300 riding in Outland. A normal 39798 cast is the control. Wildcard selection must start that same cast, remain unmounted during it, honor a native cancel request, and mount only after completion. The flying fixture also knows ground-only Brewfest Kodo 49322, which must not be selected for the flying action. The Outland coordinates come from the world game_tele HellfirePeninsula row. This observes native casts and mounted auras, not a rendered cast bar. CoA.UnlockAllVanity is off for this case, so no account collection mount is taught: the ground actor knows only 39798, and the flying actor knows 39798 plus ground-only 49322. This makes both random selections deterministic without seeding a cast or mounted aura.",
